fixture zone1_03_route_slow_finisher
doc Room 03 (BUILD.md s5 tech 3, s15 "4 bounces per second"; ADR-0019 Decision 5): what slowing the last link buys. Nine bounces at 4 a second, then an air dash 9 frames and an air dash-jump 17 frames after the ninth: the last arc is 26 frames and 520 u instead of 15 and 300, and it clears the tunnel's end. Nine bounces cross only if the chain ends slower than 4 a second (zone1_03_control_nine_bounces).
